ystemExit(\"expected TimeoutError\")\nexcept TimeoutError:\n    pass\nassert sleeps == [], sleeps\n\n# subclasses of OSError (e.g. FileNotFoundError) count as transient\ndef missing():\n    raise FileNotFoundError(\"gone\")\ntry:\n    retry(missing, attempts=2, sleep=lambda _: None)\n    raise SystemExit(\"expected FileNotFoundError\")\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    pass\n\nprint(\"ALL_CHECKS_OK\")\nEOF","description":"Run public test and edge-case assertions"}}]}}
